Subject: [PATCH] [M156] Fix synchronous completion in LocalFileStreamReader

FlyWeb pending: from branch-heads/8078 880ca0428f. Applied after pendiente/chromium/0001;
applies cleanly (identical diff). No brave-core patches or chromium_src for these files.

Original change's description:
> Fix synchronous completion in LocalFileStreamReader
>
> This CL updates LocalFileStreamReader to enforce the FileStreamReader
> asynchronous completion contract by posting inline file-access denial
> callbacks to the current sequence and avoiding callback invocation on
> synchronous stream reads.
>
> Previously, when a file-access callback denied access inline during an
> initial read, LocalFileStreamReader invoked the completion callback
> synchronously before returning ERR_IO_PENDING, allowing re-entrant
> callers such as MojoBlobReader to destroy their reader while the read
> call was still unwinding.
>
